    challengesLabel: THE CHALLENGES
    challenge: '<p data-start="200" data-end="439"><strong data-start="200" data-end="242">Stock and online store synchronization</strong><br data-start="242" data-end="245">Your stock is in a spreadsheet, your store is on Shopify or WooCommerce, and your accounting is in another tool. The result: stock errors, overselling, and hours of manual data entry every week.</p><p data-start="441" data-end="668"><strong data-start="441" data-end="480">Logistics and multichannel shipping</strong><br data-start="480" data-end="483">Manually managing carriers, labels, and parcel tracking becomes unmanageable as soon as volume increases. Without automation, your team spends more time handling shipments than selling.</p><p data-start="670" data-end="915"><strong data-start="670" data-end="707">VAT, OSS &amp; Intrastat declarations</strong><br data-start="707" data-end="710">As soon as you sell in several EU countries, VAT becomes a headache: country-specific rates, OSS thresholds, monthly Intrastat declarations. A single mistake can be costly in penalties and correction time.</p><p data-start="917" data-end="1162"><strong data-start="917" data-end="952">Returns and after-sales service</strong><br data-start="952" data-end="955">Processing returns without a centralized customer history creates negative experiences and losses that are difficult to trace. Every poorly managed return is costly for your brand image and your team’s time.</p><p data-start="1164" data-end="1350"><strong data-start="1164" data-end="1194">Margin analysis by product</strong><br data-start="1194" data-end="1197">Without a unified dashboard, it is impossible to know which products or channels are truly profitable. Purchasing and pricing decisions are made blindly.</p>'
