    - logo: cloud-computing
      heading: Online Store Connected to the ERP
      descriptionPoints: <p data-start="1410" data-end="1470">One single platform for your website, stock, and accounting.</p><ul data-start="1472" data-end="1611"><li data-start="1472" data-end="1535">Native Odoo online store or Shopify / WooCommerce connector</li><li data-start="1536" data-end="1571">Real-time stock synchronization</li><li data-start="1572" data-end="1611">Automatic price and product updates</li></ul>
    - logo: emballage
      heading: Shipping & SendCloud
      descriptionPoints: '<p data-start="1643" data-end="1709">Automate all your shipments from Odoo via the SendCloud connector.</p><ul data-start="1711" data-end="1951"><li data-start="1711" data-end="1786">Automatic selection of the cheapest carrier: Bpost, DHL, DPD, UPS, etc.</li><li data-start="1787" data-end="1832">One-click label generation from the order</li><li data-start="1833" data-end="1892">Automatic tracking and real-time customer notifications</li><li data-start="1893" data-end="1951">Simplified returns management from the customer portal</li></ul>'
    - logo: tv-options-edit-channels
      heading: VAT, OSS & Intrastat Declarations
      descriptionPoints: <p data-start="1996" data-end="2057">Stay compliant effortlessly, even when selling across Europe.</p><ul data-start="2059" data-end="2278"><li data-start="2059" data-end="2120">Automatic VAT calculation based on the customer’s country</li><li data-start="2121" data-end="2162">OSS report ready to file in one click</li><li data-start="2163" data-end="2225">Intrastat declarations automatically generated every month</li><li data-start="2226" data-end="2278">Native integrated PEPPOL e-invoicing for Belgium</li></ul>
    - logo: boucle
